---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/common/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/common/Footer.astro';
import { BookOpen, MonitorPlay, Globe, Microscope } from 'lucide-react';
---

<BaseLayout title="Academics">
  <Header />
  
  <main class="flex-grow py-12 sm:py-16 bg-school-surface">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-12">
        <h1 data-i18n="academics.title" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-school-textPrimary">Academic Structure & Curriculum</h1>
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-school-orange mx-auto mt-4 mb-4"></div>
        <p class="text-center text-school-textMuted max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base" data-en="We offer comprehensive education from Grade 1 to Grade 13, preparing students for both Ordinary Level (O/L) and Advanced Level (A/L) examinations." data-si="අපි 1 ශ්‍රේණියේ සිට 13 ශ්‍රේණිය දක්වා පූර්ණ අධ්‍යාපනයක් ලබා දෙන අතර, සාමාන්‍ය පෙළ (O/L) සහ උසස් පෙළ (A/L) විභාග සඳහා සිසුන් සූදානම් කරමු.">
          We offer comprehensive education from Grade 1 to Grade 13, preparing students for both Ordinary Level (O/L) and Advanced Level (A/L) examinations.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12 sm:mb-16">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-school-border flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-100 p-3 rounded-lg text-school-teal shrink-0">
            <BookOpen size={24} />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-school-textPrimary mb-2 font-serif" data-i18n="academics.bilingual_title">Bilingual Education</h3>
            <p class="text-school-textMuted text-sm leading-relaxed" data-en="Classes are conducted in both Sinhala and English mediums, providing students with a strong foundation for higher education." data-si="සිංහල සහ ඉංග්‍රීසි මාධ්‍ය දෙකෙන්ම පන්ති පැවැත්වෙන අතර, උසස් අධ්‍යාපනය සඳහා සිසුන්ට ශක්තිමත් පදනමක් ලබා දේ.">Classes are conducted in both <strong class="text-school-textPrimary">Sinhala</strong> and <strong class="text-school-textPrimary">English</strong> mediums, providing students with a strong foundation for higher education.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-school-border flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-100 p-3 rounded-lg text-school-orange shrink-0">
            <Globe size={24} />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-school-textPrimary mb-2 font-serif" data-i18n="academics.global_languages">Global Languages</h3>
            <p class="text-school-textMuted text-sm leading-relaxed" data-en="We prepare students for a globalized world by offering international language studies, including Chinese and Japanese." data-si="චීන සහ ජපන් ඇතුළු ජාත්‍යන්තර භාෂා අධ්‍යයනය ලබා දෙමින් ගෝලීයකරණය වූ ලෝකයකට අපි සිසුන් සූදානම් කරමු.">We prepare students for a globalized world by offering international language studies, including <strong class="text-school-textPrimary">Chinese</strong> and <strong class="text-school-textPrimary">Japanese</strong>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-school-textPrimary" data-i18n="academics.facilities_learning">Facilities & Learning</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-school-border overflow-hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 divide-y sm:divide-y-0 sm:divide-x divide-school-border">
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
            <div class="p-3 bg-teal-50 border border-teal-100 rounded-lg text-school-teal w-fit mb-4">
              <MonitorPlay size={24} />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-school-textPrimary mb-2 font-serif" data-i18n="academics.it_laboratories">IT Laboratories</h3>
            <p class="text-school-textMuted text-sm leading-relaxed" data-en="Fully equipped IT laboratories featuring modern computers and digital learning resources to ensure students are prepared for the modern digital age." data-si="නවීන පරිගණක සහ ඩිජිටල් ඉගෙනුම් සම්පත් වලින් සමන්විත තොරතුරු තාක්ෂණාගාර, සිසුන් නවීන ඩිජිටල් යුගයට සූදානම් කිරීම සහතික කරයි.">Fully equipped IT laboratories featuring modern computers and digital learning resources to ensure students are prepared for the modern digital age.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
            <div class="p-3 bg-purple-50 border border-purple-100 rounded-lg text-school-maroon w-fit mb-4">
              <Microscope size={24} />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-school-textPrimary mb-2 font-serif" data-i18n="academics.science_stream">Science Stream</h3>
            <p class="text-school-textMuted text-sm leading-relaxed" data-en="Specialized Biology, Chemistry, and Physics laboratories designed specifically for our A/L science stream students to conduct practical experiments." data-si="උසස් පෙළ විද්‍යා අංශයේ සිසුන්ට ප්‍රායෝගික පරීක්ෂණ සිදු කිරීම සඳහා විශේෂයෙන් නිර්මාණය කර ඇති ජීව විද්‍යා, රසායන විද්‍යා සහ භෞතික විද්‍යාගාර.">Specialized Biology, Chemistry, and Physics laboratories designed specifically for our A/L science stream students to conduct practical experiments.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
